# Go along (UI scenario), guest c (k10, switch_pro pictures): to a's row in stag0201 through the gate form (its pad line shot), then
# waits for a's notice; its UI script answers it (the F1 menu, A). It arrives in dng204b1 by the GO.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until frames>=2700
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until frames>=240
shot c01_gate_prompt
idle until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail stagechange
log c sees the notice
shot c02_notice
idle until stage=dng204b1,control
log c went along into dng204b1
idle until frames>=400000
